[node name="Instructions" type="RichTextLabel" parent="HowToPlayPanel/VBox"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Behind the Smile[/b] is a narrative adventure about empathy and choices.

[b][color=#7ac5cd]GAMEPLAY[/color][/b]
• Read the story as it unfolds on screen.
• When choices appear, click one to decide your action.
• Your choices are remembered and affect how characters respond.
• Different choices lead to different endings.

[b][color=#d4a86a]CONTROLS[/color][/b]
• [b]Mouse Click[/b] — Select choices and advance dialogue.
• [b]M Key[/b] — Open/close the Memory Log.

[b][color=#b38aad]MEMORY LOG[/color][/b]
• Press [b]M[/b] or click the Memory Log button during gameplay.
• See what the game remembers about your actions.
• The log shows established facts, your recorded interactions, and Maya's trust level.

[b][color=#8aad8a]ABOUT[/color][/b]
This game explores Problem 09 — NPC Memory Without Invented Lore.
Maya remembers exactly what you did (and didn't do). She will never claim something happened that didn't.

[b]Play through multiple times to see how different choices change the story![/b]"
fit_content = false
scroll_active = true

